SUMMARY:Celebrate National Dueling Dinosaurs Day!
DESCRIPTION:The last Saturday of April is now officially National Dueling Dinosaurs Day! \nHelp us celebrate our famous fossilized friends Murphy the Triceratops and Manteo the Nanotyrannus with a visit to the SECU Dino Lab! In honor of this special day\, we will be hosting the following themed programs: \n  \n10:00am – 12:00pm: Family Painting Class: Dinosaur!  – Create your own 11″ x 14″ painted dino masterpiece to take home! (Tickets are required for this event.) \n  \n1:00pm – 1:30pm: Science TODAY: National Dueling Dinosaurs Day – Join NCMNS paleontologist Dr. Jennifer Anné and host Chris Smith in the SECU Daily Planet Theater to hear what it’s like to work in the lab that’s home to the Dueling Dinosaurs. \n  \nTo take the party home with you\, you can purchase a Nanotyrannus t-shirt in the Museum Store at a 20% discount — for Dueling Dinos Day only! \n 
URL:https://naturalsciences.org/calendar/event/celebrate-national-dueling-dinosaurs-day/
LOCATION:Downtown Raleigh\, 11 West Jones Street\, Raleigh\, NC\, 27601\, United States
CATEGORIES:All Ages,Walk-up Programs
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://naturalsciences.org/calendar/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/National-DD-Day.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Jessica%20McNeill":MAILTO:jessica.mcneill@naturalsciences.org
GEO:35.7822735;-78.6395502
