SUMMARY:Biodiversity of the Night
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an exploration of night sounds and wildlife at Prairie Ridge on the second day of the City Nature Challenge!  We’ll start this program for ages 10+ with a brief introduction to iNaturalist before guiding your exploration of frog and owl calls\, moths\, and other nighttime visitors to our site.  We’ll keep the moth lights on until 11:00pm\, but you’re welcome to leave any time! \nRegistration is required to attend this program. \nRegister
URL:https://naturalsciences.org/calendar/event/biodiversity-of-the-night/
