SUMMARY:Member Preview: Penguin Island
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a Member-exclusive preview of our next movie\, Penguin Island. Enjoy the extended 40-minute cut of the film\, exclusively for this event. The film chronicles a King as he searches for a mate in the sub-Antarctic Crozet Archipelago. After the movie\, Dr. David Johnston from Duke University for “On Thin Ice – Penguins in a Warming World.” Learn adaptations penguins have to stay alive and what that means in the face of climate change. Bring your questions for Q&A after the talk! \nDoors open at 6pm. Movie begins at 6:30pm. \nCurrent membership and pre-registration required. Recommended for all ages. Not a member yet? Join today! \nSpace is limited\, Register Now!
URL:https://naturalsciences.org/calendar/event/member-preview-penguin-island/
LOCATION:Downtown Raleigh\, 11 West Jones Street\, Raleigh\, NC\, 27601\, United States
CATEGORIES:Adults,All Ages,Children,Member Exclusive
ORGANIZER;CN="Katie%20Cupp":MAILTO:Katie.Cupp@naturalsciences.org
GEO:35.7822735;-78.6395502
