SUMMARY:Intro to Herpetology
DESCRIPTION:Herpetology is the study of reptiles and amphibians and the May-June season for ecoEXPLORE! Join us to learn more about reptiles and amphibians\, the people who study them\, and how to get good photos of them for your Herpetology badge! \nThis program is aimed at kids in grades K-8 interested in being a part of the ecoEXPLORE collaborative science project\, but all are welcome. \nRegister
URL:https://naturalsciences.org/calendar/event/intro-to-herpetology-2026/
LOCATION:Virtual\, NC\, United States
CATEGORIES:Children,Citizen Science,ecoEXPLORE,K-12 Students,Teens,Virtual
ORGANIZER;CN="ecoEXPLORE%20Team":MAILTO:ecoexplore@naturalsciences.org
END:VEVENT
